## .env File Security Checklist

- [ ] **Always** add `.env` files to `.gitignore`
- [ ] Create `.env.example` with placeholder values for documentation
- [ ] Use `chmod 600 .env` to restrict file permissions
- [ ] Never commit actual secrets, only canary/test values
- [ ] Implement secret scanning in CI/CD pipelines
- [ ] Regularly rotate secrets, especially for external services
- [ ] Use different secrets for each environment (dev/staging/prod)
- [ ] Implement secret access logging and audit trails

